{
  "_comment": "Minecraft brewing is hard-coded (no recipe JSON), so this table supplies it: each potion type -> the distinct reagent items its brew needs. The acquisition compiler gates a potion behind a brewing stand + Knowledge: Brewing + acquiring every reagent. long_/strong_ variants share their base type's reagents (plus redstone/glowstone, treated as trivial).",
